\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Average performance of the proposed TSCP method and alternative conformal prediction approaches on simulated data with $d=10$ outcome variables and heterogeneous noise variances. The target coverage level is $90\%$. TSCP consistently attains near-nominal coverage while producing the smallest prediction sets on average. Numerical results and corresponding standard deviations are reported in Table~\ref {tab:gaussian-heter}. }}{20}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:gaussian-heter}{{3}{20}{Average performance of the proposed TSCP method and alternative conformal prediction approaches on simulated data with $d=10$ outcome variables and heterogeneous noise variances. The target coverage level is $90\%$. TSCP consistently attains near-nominal coverage while producing the smallest prediction sets on average. Numerical results and corresponding standard deviations are reported in Table~\ref {tab:gaussian-heter}}{figure.caption.3}{}}
